$273 million in revenues, with record second quarter revenues in both Corporate Finance and Financial Advisory Services, and we had a solid quarter in Financial Restructuring compared to an exceptional second quarter in Financial Restructuring last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2020 Q2","e":"hli","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"…result of this differentiated platform, we believe we continue to gain market share and grow our Corporate Finance and Financial Advisory businesses while maintaining a natural hedge against an economic downturn with the largest and most diversified financial restructuring practice on The Street.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2020 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2020-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Our Financial Restructuring business continues to perform well, despite the current low default environment in the credit markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2020 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2020-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Ongoing technology disruptors, changes in consumer buying habits, company mismanagement and over-leverage have all contributed to current growth in a restructuring business without the typical characteristics of a business downturn or higher interest rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2020 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2020-02-03","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Manan Gosalia","x":"And I know you reiterated outlook for the 14% to 15% range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2020 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Corporate Finance and Financial and Valuation Advisory achieved record results and Financial Restructuring had its second best year ever.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2020 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Activity in our restructuring business has increased significantly in the last two months and the size and complexity of transactions have increased as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q1","e":"hli","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"J. Lindsey Alley","x":"And so we essentially -- we may lose up to $17 million of pass-through revenues that we had normally tied our compensation expense ratio too.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q1","e":"hli","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"At the same time, the opportunities for us in financial restructuring have expanded significantly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q1","e":"hli","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"However, as has been the case through other periods of financial change and disruption, the near-term impact on our M&A business has occurred faster than the anticipated growth in financial restructuring revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q2","e":"hli","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Our second quarter benefited from a significant increase in closings in Financial Restructuring, very strong capital markets and an improving M&A in valuation market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q2","e":"hli","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Our Financial Restructuring results are at record levels and we expect to experience elevated levels for some time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Financial Restructuring achieved $178 million in revenues, 42% above its previous record.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Corporate Finance revenues and prospects quickly deteriorated while Financial Restructuring prospects rapidly increased.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2021-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"In the spring of 2020, with the rapid impact of the global pandemic, activity levels in our financial restructuring practice significantly increased, mitigating the reduction in M&A activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2021 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2021-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"By early fall of 2020, these trends reversed with similar speed as new financial restructuring opportunities returned to a more normal pace and our Corporate Finance business began to spring back from an almost complete pause in new business activity, and activity levels in our valuation business…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q4-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2022 Q1","e":"hli","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"And Financial Restructuring delivered strong revenues and continued to maintain its significant market share during a challenging restructuring market environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2022 Q1","e":"hli","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Our Financial Restructuring business continues to slow in the torrid pace it experienced last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2022 Q2","e":"hli","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Corporate Finance and Financial and Valuation Advisory produced record quarterly results, and Financial Restructuring delivered solid results during a very challenging restructuring market environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q2-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2022 Q2","e":"hli","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott L. Beiser","x":"Our Financial Restructuring business continues to perform as expected in this bullish market environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/houlihan-lokey-inc-hli-q2-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HLI 2026 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lindsey Alley","x":"Financial Restructuring revenues were $156 million for the quarter, a 19% increase versus the same period last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/houlihan-lokey-hli-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HLI 2026 Q3","e":"hli","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lindsey Alley","x":"…out of non-compensation expenses $2.2 million in integration and acquisition-related costs, $1.3 million in non-cash acquisition-related amortization, and $600,000 pertaining to professional fees associated with streamlining our global organizational structure, also referred to as Project Solo.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/houlihan-lokey-hli-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HLI 2026 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"J. Alley","x":"And so it is -- we're able to spread the investments we make, whether it's in AI or whatever across really those 2 businesses, in particular, also will benefit our Restructuring business as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/houlihan-lokey-hli-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HLI 2026 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"J. Alley","x":"Financial Restructuring revenues were $110 million for the quarter, ending the fiscal year with revenues of $529 million, down 3% from fiscal year 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/houlihan-lokey-hli-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HLI 2026 Q4","e":"hli","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"J. Alley","x":"Look, I think that the transaction, the average transaction size for Restructuring, there are no trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/houlihan-lokey-hli-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HLI 2027 Q1","e":"hli","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Stein","x":"Was it all tech or AI spend, investments for the future?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/houlihan-lokey-hli-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"H